Let's go into more depth.

4
00:00:15,630 --> 00:00:18,231
So the purpose of the
project charter, formal

5
00:00:18,232 --> 00:00:21,244
authorization for the project to begin.

6
00:00:21,350 --> 00:00:25,690
Remember in the PMI world, we do not have
