7
00:00:26,470 --> 00:00:32,110
So it will show the business justification
of the project, why the project exists.

8
00:00:32,930 --> 00:00:35,570
So we will definitely list the need for
the project.

9
00:00:35,571 --> 00:00:40,670
Outlines the project's measurable
objectives, related success criteria.

10
00:00:41,530 --> 00:00:42,730
This is at a high level.

11
00:00:43,190 --> 00:00:46,270
This is a high level document signed off.

12
00:00:46,690 --> 00:00:51,210
They might say published by the project
sponsor or initiator.

13
00:00:51,990 --> 00:00:56,712
So it identifies the sponsor
who is funding the project

14
00:00:56,713 --> 00:00:59,810
and the project manager
and their authority levels.

15
00:00:59,990 --> 00:01:05,550
It contains high level requirements,
scope, risk, summary budget.

16
00:01:05,570 --> 00:01:07,210
budget, summary schedule.

17
00:01:07,810 --> 00:01:08,860
Those are high level.

18
00:01:10,570 --> 00:01:13,930
High level assumptions and constraints we
already know about.

19
00:01:14,610 --> 00:01:17,359
Pre-assigned resources meaning promised

20
00:01:17,360 --> 00:01:21,044
resources, team, people,
