23
00:01:32,470 --> 00:01:35,690
So the PM's role in creating the project
charter.

24
00:01:35,890 --> 00:01:38,502
They can assist in
writing the project charter

25
00:01:38,503 --> 00:01:41,004
or the PM can write
the entire project charter.

26
00:01:41,550 --> 00:01:45,641
If you're a senior level
project manager, we're

27
00:01:45,642 --> 00:01:48,824
often being asked to
