28
00:01:49,270 --> 00:01:53,370
But the sponsor or initiator will sign it.

29
00:01:53,890 --> 00:01:55,640
And we'll do a benefits evaluation.

30
00:01:55,750 --> 00:01:59,410
Is the project in line with the
organization's strategic plan?

31
00:01:59,910 --> 00:02:02,810
So that is our job to make sure it is.

32
00:02:03,350 --> 00:02:04,370
We'll communicate.

33
00:02:04,390 --> 00:02:07,036
communicate to the appropriate
key stakeholders, letting

34
00:02:07,037 --> 00:02:11,270
them know we've got a
project authorized to begin.

35
00:02:12,490 --> 00:02:16,070
So the project charter also be called an
overview statement.

36
00:02:16,830 --> 00:02:19,550
It's an executive summary of the project
charter.

37
00:02:20,230 --> 00:02:22,525
Elevator pitch communicates the intent and

38
00:02:22,526 --> 00:02:25,924
vision of the project
must be clear and concise.

39
00:02:26,330 --> 00:02:28,430
But note, I'm going to read this.

40
00:02:28,830 --> 00:02:32,482
Authorization of the project
starts when the project charter

41
00:02:32,483 --> 00:02:35,550
